        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi Musa yaheelesia inusu yoluyia lwaManase obulaame; bwakabilwa inusu yoluyia lwabaana baManase, ebilibwa biabwe shinga olwa biali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.29",
