              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neinusu yaGileadi, naAshitarotsi, naEderei, amataala akomuburuchi bwaOgu muBashani, kakabilwa abaana baMakhiri waManase, mbu inusu yabaana baMakhiri, ebilibwa biabwe shinga olwa biali.",
          "type": "text",
